<title>BELGIUM: Royale Belge results now due on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Royale Belge results now due on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian insurance company Royale Belge SA said first-half 1996 earnings would be released on Wednesday instead of Tuesday as planned.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the delay.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
